   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Nested lists"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "A list can contain another list as an element; this is a nested list. L[i] gives the inner list and L[i][j] gives element j of that inner list. A nested list is a natural way to store a table of rows and columns.",
    "kn": "ಒಂದು ಲಿಸ್ಟ್ ಇನ್ನೊಂದು ಲಿಸ್ಟನ್ನು ಅಂಶವಾಗಿ ಹೊಂದಬಹುದು; ಇದು ನೆಸ್ಟೆಡ್ ಲಿಸ್ಟ್. L[i] ಒಳಗಿನ ಲಿಸ್ಟ್, L[i][j] ಅದರ j ನೇ ಅಂಶ. ಸಾಲು-ಕಾಲಂ ಕೋಷ್ಟಕಕ್ಕೆ ಇದು ಸೂಕ್ತ."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "Row i, column j → L[i][j]"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "A list can contain another list as an element; this is a nested list. L[i] gives the inner list and L[i][j] gives element j of that inner list. A nested list is a natural way to store a table of rows and columns.",
